      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;This wasn't what the ex-princess wanted. She hadn't planned on making out with Sparkles. She had only given her a drug to help her with the person she loved, an archer and tech master named Bow. Even so, she was enjoying herself, more than she had thought, despite the reactions of Bow, Adora, and Catra. In the story that follows, this ex-princess will begin one out-there experiment and then start another, which is even more dangerous than the first. Strap in and enjoy the ride!&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>lefemmerouge</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
